 Why: No bindable C function prototypes found for `logging`; skipped `log_line`: variadic (`...`) parameters aren't bindable.
 Fix: Fix the header path, install dev headers, run `jet inspect bind` manually for details, or hand-write `#Import c.logging: module`.
